      "sourceRefs": [
        "NAMCARs 139.17.2",
        "NAMCATS 139.17.2"
      ],
      "originalText": "Is a system of preventive maintenance of disabled aircraft removal equipment employed to ensure effectiveness of the equipment and compliance with the specified procedure for the removal of disabled aircraft?",
