      "sourceRefs": [
        "NAMCARs 139.17.2",
        "NAMCATS 139.17.2"
      ],
      "originalText": "Is a system of preventive maintenance of electrical system employed to ensure effectiveness of the equipment and compliance with the specified requirements for primary supply, secondary supply, and switch-over time?",
