      "sourceRefs": [
        "NAMCARs 139.17.2",
        "NAMCATS 139.17.2"
      ],
      "originalText": "Are the surfaces of all movement areas inspected and their conditions monitored regularly as part of an aerodrome preventive and corrective maintenance mechanism with the objective of avoiding and eliminating any loose objects/debris that might cause damage to aircraft or impair the operation of aircraft systems?",
