      "sourceLocator": "PDF page 3; protocol AGA 048.204; Protocol question column",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "NAMCARs 139.17.2",
        "NAMCATS 139.17.2"
      ],
      "originalText": "Is the surface of the runway and taxiway shoulders maintained to be free of any loose stones or other objects that could be ingested by the aeroplane engines?",
