      "sourceRefs": [
        "NAMCARs 139.17.2",
        "NAMCATS 139.17.2"
      ],
      "originalText": "Is there a programme in place to ensure that standing water, mud, dust, sand, oil, rubber deposits and other contaminants are removed from the surface of runways in use as rapidly and completely as possible to minimize accumulation?",
